On of the main advantages a tourist has in the early game is the
ability to use a wide variety of semi decent weapons fairly well.  I
would say the best are unicorn horns, mattocks, sabers, and daggers. 
You probably don't want to wield daggers much (unless you get
magicbane), but they are excellent for throwing.

I would say use a silver saber if, by some miracle, you get one early.
 Dual weild once you are trained.  Otherwise, try for a unicorn horn
early.  Use a wand or your pet.  If that doesn't seem to be working
for you, try to get to the mines and grab a mattock.  Those all do
good damage for the early game.  I know many people will disagree, but
I would train one of those up to level 2 ASAP.  It doesn't cost you
that much in the long run.  Maybe even enchant it up a bit, if you
can.  With a tourist, I say do whatever it takes to survive the early
game; you'll be just fine if you make it to the late game.

